                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "ec6f0fc3-3e49-3f99-9fb5-265876a163b6",
                        "entry_id": "22b2734f-5ff0-3d78-89fe-18792a095a5b",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Qui n’est pas réel, qui est illusoire."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "7a8c194c-57fb-42f8-9d47-7da2b7bd6687",
                                "sense_id": "ec6f0fc3-3e49-3f99-9fb5-265876a163b6",
                                "text": "Vos craintes sont irréelles."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "98220a24-b47a-4187-8508-e2e0daae3e5e",
                                "sense_id": "ec6f0fc3-3e49-3f99-9fb5-265876a163b6",
                                "text": "Cet animal est irréel"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "be9d6bc2-447d-3d37-9668-ccf337c00903",
                        "entry_id": "22b2734f-5ff0-3d78-89fe-18792a095a5b",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Qui semble être sorti de la réalité."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "hyperbole"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "1f7d1640-f68c-410a-a128-9b9f665fd03d",
                                "sense_id": "be9d6bc2-447d-3d37-9668-ccf337c00903",
                                "text": "C’était à la fois irréel et fantastique. Je zigzaguais pour trouver le moyen de sortir de ces masses de vapeur d’eau."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "e1d63dfa-90f3-41ee-a256-05ca1aa31e03",
                                "sense_id": "be9d6bc2-447d-3d37-9668-ccf337c00903",
                                "text": "Les clients paraissent se mouvoir lentement, comme pris dans une espèce de torpeur, celle que dégage la vision quasi irréelle de l’amoncellement de nourriture et d’objets."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "e6ba477c-87c8-4222-b692-d65318bd3890",
                                "sense_id": "be9d6bc2-447d-3d37-9668-ccf337c00903",
                                "text": "On te demande pas d’être rationnel, mais de désétriquer ton cerveau, et d’accepter la dimension presque irréelle et émotionnelle d’une histoire qui n’est pas vraiment la vie mais l’est quand même un peu…"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "2452a37d-4d04-3ca1-8929-80310a855a3d",
                        "entry_id": "22b2734f-5ff0-3d78-89fe-18792a095a5b",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Qui n’existe qu’à l’état d’invention imaginative ou de conception logique."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "f70fd37b-41ba-4d00-85e7-d0788900844a",
                                "sense_id": "2452a37d-4d04-3ca1-8929-80310a855a3d",
                                "text": "Spéculations irréelles."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "ad22230d-1183-3cb2-bf2a-8a4f8c6f253d",
                        "entry_id": "22b2734f-5ff0-3d78-89fe-18792a095a5b",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Pseudo-nombres impossibles à “plonger” dans l’ensemble des nombres réels, également à l’origine appelés imaginaires, aujourd'hui complexes, mais qui simplifient de façon éblouissante certains calculs, en particuliers trigonométriques."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "07f0ea06-a449-4a4f-94c6-840cd5688db2",
                                "sense_id": "ad22230d-1183-3cb2-bf2a-8a4f8c6f253d",
                                "text": "Le nombre imaginaire dont le carré serait égal au nombre réel –1 est désigné par le symbole i."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "d7241417-6a01-44cc-934f-c4b5d3561636",
                        "source_entry_id": "22b2734f-5ff0-3d78-89fe-18792a095a5b",
                        "target_lang_word": "unwirklich",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "unwirklich",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3a1b042f-c171-3b17-b2f9-fe857577c368",
                                        "entry_id": "263f63d0-e8ea-3aa5-9fa6-dba0cc442653",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "scheinbar nicht der Wirklichkeit/der Realität entsprechend"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "376b06f1-0271-40e8-85c4-3e4eafcb8efa",
                                                "sense_id": "3a1b042f-c171-3b17-b2f9-fe857577c368",
                                                "text": "Der Saal war in unwirkliches Licht getaucht."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9d5a2599-86b6-4551-bc49-532b4113dee7",
                                                "sense_id": "3a1b042f-c171-3b17-b2f9-fe857577c368",
                                                "text": "Diese Situation kam ihm unwirklich vor."
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "280bc324-a17c-49da-ae7e-38058adc5ea1",
                        "source_entry_id": "22b2734f-5ff0-3d78-89fe-18792a095a5b",
                        "target_lang_word": "unreal",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "unreal",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e8dbf2fd-5ae0-355f-9ec8-a2d763c3c63d",
                                        "entry_id": "d56a2854-57b6-3280-b3bb-9160b0281e5e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Not real or substantial; having no actual presence in reality; lacking the characteristics of reality."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7c25e040-060b-4d76-b39a-70323de3bce0",
                                                "sense_id": "e8dbf2fd-5ae0-355f-9ec8-a2d763c3c63d",
                                                "text": "The word ‘ivory’ rang in the air, was whispered, was sighed. You would think they were praying to it. A taint of imbecile rapacity blew through it all, like a whiff from some corpse. By Jove! I’ve never seen anything so unreal in my life."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a504765b-7056-47bb-8078-c4920a39728e",
                                                "sense_id": "e8dbf2fd-5ae0-355f-9ec8-a2d763c3c63d",
                                                "text": "\"The Boy's Uncle made me Real,\" he said. \"That was a great many years ago; but once you are Real you can't become unreal again. It lasts for always.\""
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "fde87b79-a953-399a-a05f-fdea2df20890",
                                        "entry_id": "d56a2854-57b6-3280-b3bb-9160b0281e5e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "very impressive; amazing; unbelievable; incredible; larger or more fantastic than typical of real life."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "informal"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a6674e99-12ea-46c7-bbea-0e9e99150479",
                                                "sense_id": "fde87b79-a953-399a-a05f-fdea2df20890",
                                                "text": "The video includes unreal footage of an eight-metre wave."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9ca76c9d-177e-40dc-8e60-642f1dd41259",
                                                "sense_id": "fde87b79-a953-399a-a05f-fdea2df20890",
                                                "text": "I just had an unreal hamburger."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bf692e34-d7a1-4971-a9b2-3e68e3ebc514",
                                                "sense_id": "fde87b79-a953-399a-a05f-fdea2df20890",
                                                "text": "He stops his cab at every traffic light, unrolls his window and calls out to the other drivers: \"I've got a movie star in the car! Follow me down to see her come out. She is unreal, man! I am in seventh heaven! I have a dream!\""
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "94e9e63e-3181-4536-9177-cab462300051",
                                                "sense_id": "fde87b79-a953-399a-a05f-fdea2df20890",
                                                "text": "\"She just set me up\" \"Now that's unreal, man. I mean, we're talking about a fairly considerable sum here, aren't we, Dexter?\" \"Listen to me. She set me up, with a dude she was cheatin' on me with"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b2004dd9-f4a8-4715-8b9d-e3703f1e0ecc",
                                                "sense_id": "fde87b79-a953-399a-a05f-fdea2df20890",
                                                "text": "“Yeah, she does have a certain mental toughness that is unreal,” agreed Berto. “I really don't think of her as a girl, I mean, it's like she's a tough buddy or tough sister to me.”"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b580f5c5-8b2b-4b88-8330-b331125c646d",
                                                "sense_id": "fde87b79-a953-399a-a05f-fdea2df20890",
                                                "text": "He walks around and tries to pluck a flower on the ground. david exclaims, “Holy shit, this is unreal! i can feel the flower, the heat from the sun, and i can even hear the wind! The smells are so vibrant! How could i possibly be smelling flowers?"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "9f0e2abe-cc3d-4837-afbc-fa6f0dd69f2c",
                        "source_entry_id": "22b2734f-5ff0-3d78-89fe-18792a095a5b",
                        "target_lang_word": "irreal",
                        "target_lang_code": "es",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "irreal",
